# TeamChoice Crash!!! — HARD STOP (read before any client ECS edit)

**Proven loop:** Join Team → `TeamChoiceResult` → ship Instantiates → `Settling` stays **OFF** → ungated client query → native `Crash!!!`. Agents keep reintroducing this (2026-07-19, 2026-07-22). Full detail: `titan-orbit-windows-join-crash.mdc`.

## Mandatory gates (copy these — do not invent weaker ones)

| Query kind | Required early-out |
|---|---|
| **Ships** (`WithEntityAccess`, `EnsureShipProxies`, local-ship tag) | `ClientJoinSettleCache.ShouldSkipShipEntityQueries` |
| **Map bodies** (planet / asteroid / gem / moon gathers) | `ClientJoinSettleCache.ShouldSkipMapBodyQueries` |

```csharp
// Ships — Settling OR GhostSpawnBacklog (TeamChoice Instantiates window)
if (ClientJoinSettleCache.ShouldSkipShipEntityQueries) return;

// Map bodies — TransformQuarantine OR Settling (quarantine is session-long on Windows)
if (ClientJoinSettleCache.ShouldSkipMapBodyQueries) return;
```

## Absolute forbidden

1. Gate client map gathers on **`Settling` alone** — Settling is OFF after Join Team; Crash!!! still happens.
2. Gate ship presentation on **`Settling` alone** — need `GhostSpawnBacklog` / `ShouldSkipShipEntityQueries`.
3. Re-enable `TransformSystemGroup` after late-join.
4. Add a new client `foreach` / `ToEntityArray` / `WithEntityAccess` over ships or map bodies **without** the helper above.
5. `EntityManager.GetEntityTypeHandle()` + chunk walk in visualizer/systems — stale handle NRE kills Pending drain → bar stuck (Player.log 2026-07-22). Use `ToEntityArray` on Pending/SpawnRequest only.
6. “Editor works so Windows is fine” — verify Windows Relay Player.log only.
7. Treat removing these checks as cleanup/refactor — it is a **regression bug**.

## Pre-edit checklist (any client system / hybrid bridge)

- [ ] New/changed client ECS query uses `ShouldSkipShipEntityQueries` or `ShouldSkipMapBodyQueries`?
- [ ] No Settling-only early-out for ships or map bodies?
- [ ] `RequireForUpdate<ShipTag>` systems: first run is often **exactly** TeamChoice Instantiates — gate before any map gather.

If unsure → skip the query; do not ship ungated. Detail + ownership file list: `titan-orbit-windows-join-crash.mdc`.
